{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01I4:proof", "parent_tag": "01HX", "chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "This is just an application of Lemma <REF_0001>.\nFirst of all, by that lemma, the affine scheme\n<MATH_0001> is the final object in the category\nof locally ringed spaces. Thus the first displayed formula\nfollows from the second. To prove the second note that\nfor any locally ringed space <MATH_0002> we have\n<MATH_0003>\nwhich proves the formula.\nSee Categories, Section <REF_0002> for the\nrelevant definitions.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-morphism-into-affine}", "MATH_0001": "$\\Spec(\\mathbf{Z})$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "\\begin{eqnarray*}\n\\Mor(X, \\Spec(A \\otimes_R B))\n& = &\n\\Hom(A \\otimes_R B, \\mathcal{O}_X(X)) \\\\\n& = &\n\\Hom(A, \\mathcal{O}_X(X))\n\\times_{\\Hom(R, \\mathcal{O}_X(X))}\n\\Hom(B, \\mathcal{O}_X(X)) \\\\\n& = &\n\\Mor(X, \\Spec(A))\n\\times_{\\Mor(X, \\Spec(R))}\n\\Mor(X, \\Spec(B))\n\\end{eqnarray*}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-section-fibre-products}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:932021c7e93e527d5d86d227d37d74a65300b78e32051b68f71a567216bf24aa", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d5ae75f4215b0dbc730f118cfe1a7ea3edf37bf9153c134a942c2166e35bd51b", "source_math_hash": "sha256:35b595715b8e74e0df93b4e1522968811c52205421753cebd43f4e149da24c67"}
